    "Replace code" : {"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"استبدال الرمز"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Code ersetzen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Replace code"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reemplazar código"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remplacer le code"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コードを変更"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"코드 바꾸기"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Substituir código"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Заменить код"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thay mã"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更换代码"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更換代碼"}}}},
    "Replace the class code?" : {"localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"استبدال رمز الصف؟"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Den Kurscode ersetzen?"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Replace the class code?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Reemplazar el código de clase?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remplacer le code de classe ?"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"クラスコードを変更しますか？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"수업 코드를 바꿀까요?"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Substituir o código da turma?"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Заменить код класса?"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thay mã lớp?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更换班级代码？"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更換班級代碼？"}}}},
